---
import ReactGrab from "../components/ReactGrab.astro";
import "../styles/automorphic.css";

const signupUrl = "/waitlist";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <ReactGrab />
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Charts, AI conversations, and macro context in one trading research workspace. Explore the market with Automorphic." />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/InterVariable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#080b12" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Automorphic — A clearer view of the markets." />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A trading research workspace with live charts, configurable indicators, AI macros, and local price alerts." />
    <link rel="icon" href="/automorphic-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <title>Automorphic — A clearer view of the markets.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header>
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Automorphic home"><img src="/automorphic-mark.svg" width="34" height="34" alt="" />Automorphic</a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#workspace">Workspace</a><a href="#approach">Approach</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></nav>
      <a class="nav-cta" href={signupUrl}>Sign up</a>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="atmosphere" aria-hidden="true"><div class="glow"></div><div class="ribbons"></div><div class="horizon"></div></div>
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> AI-powered trading</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">A clearer view<br />of the markets.</h1>
          <p class="lede">Your own trading assistant, to prevent your next tilt.</p>
          <p class="description">Explore the market with AI. Think through ideas in your own words. See the macro picture.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary" href={signupUrl}>Sign up </a><a class="text-link" href="#workspace">Inside the workspace </a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="workspace content" id="workspace" aria-labelledby="workspace-title">
        <div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">01 / The workspace</p><h2 id="workspace-title">Familiar charts.<br />A new way to work.</h2><p>Your charts, AI conversations, and macro news. One workspace.</p></div>
        <figure class="workspace-preview">
          <a href="/workspace-snapshot.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View the full-size Automorphic workspace screenshot">
            <img class="workspace-snapshot" src="/workspace-snapshot.jpg" width="1258" height="938" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Automorphic workspace with its sidebar, an NQ futures chart, and the Live Wires macro news panel." />
          </a>
        </figure>
      </section>
      <section class="research-lenses content" aria-label="What Automorphic is building">
        <article><p class="eyebrow">Plain-language backtests</p><h3>Ask for the backtest.</h3><p>What if testing a strategy were as simple as describing it?</p></article>
        <article><p class="eyebrow">AI indicators &amp; alerts</p><h3>Make the chart follow your rules.</h3><p>Shape your chart around the way you trade.</p></article>
        <article><p class="eyebrow">AI macros</p><h3>When the macro picture disagrees.</h3><p>See how breaking news could support—or challenge—your trade.</p></article>
      </section>
      <section class="approach content" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Our vision</p><h2 id="approach-title">Have more confidence in your setup.<br />Test your edge.</h2><p class="approach-lede">From a trading idea to a testable strategy, in your own words.</p>
          <div class="research-example">
            <p class="eyebrow">A new era in trading</p>
            <blockquote>“I’m new to silver. Give three agents four hours to research and backtest a technical edge targeting an 80% win rate over a large sample.”</blockquote>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="principles">
          <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Describe the setup</h3><p>“How often do double bottoms reach the prior high? Do 2 p.m. shorts work after a strongly bullish open?”</p></div></article>
          <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Refine the rules</h3><p>Adjust your entries, exits, and risk.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Put it through a backtest</h3><p>Inspect the trades, costs, and drawdowns.</p></div></article>
          <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Watch the setup in context</h3><p>Follow your setup alongside the news that could change it.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="faq content" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
        <div class="faq-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">03 / A few questions</p>
          <h2 id="faq-title">Before you<br />get started.</h2>
          <p>The ideas behind Automorphic, and how it can fit your trading.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details open>
            <summary>What’s the vision for Automorphic?</summary>
            <p>A workspace where a trading question can become a research plan, a testable strategy, and a result you can inspect. We’re building toward delegating research to AI agents, with you setting the scope and reviewing the evidence.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What can it help me with?</summary>
            <p>Explore price action, adjust indicators, annotate your chart, and consider the macro news around a setup. Use an AI assistant in your local workspace to discuss ideas and organize your research.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Why use this instead of TradingView?</summary>
            <p>Automorphic is for traders who want charts supercharged with AI. Try it if that fits how you think through a trade.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can it guarantee profits or an 80% win rate?</summary>
            <p>No. A win-rate target is a question to investigate, not a promised outcome. A backtest can fail that target, and historical results don’t guarantee future performance. Win rate alone also leaves out trade size, costs, and drawdowns.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What can I use today?</summary>
            <p>Explore trading ideas with built-in, configurable indicators and alerts. Bring your charts, drawing tools, AI macros, and assistant together in one workspace.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="closing content" id="waitlist"><img src="/automorphic-mark.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="" /><h2>Time to experiment with<br />your craziest trading ideas.</h2><p class="closing-copy">AI beside the market. Your reasoning at the center.</p><a class="primary" href={signupUrl}>Sign up </a></section>
    </main>

    <footer><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/automorphic-mark.svg" width="25" height="25" alt="" />Automorphic</a><span>AI-powered trading</span><span>{new Date().getFullYear()}</span></footer>
  </body>
</html>
